  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SONELGAZ EQUIPMENT FOR COMPUTERIZATION PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INTRODUCTION OF A COMPUTER NETWORK TO COVER THE HEADQUARTER OF SONELGAZ AND ITS REGIONAL OFFICES THROUGHOUT THE COUNTRY IN ORDER TO ENHANCE THE EFFICIENCY AND INCREASE THE PROFITA_ BILITY OF THE COMPANY.PROJECT INCLUDES THE ACQUISITION  COMMISSIONING OF ONE CENTERAL MAINFRAME, 41 MINI AND 1025 MICRO COMPUTERS WITH ALL THE RELATED PERIPHERICAL EQUIPMENT.  TRAINING OF SOFTWARES FOR THEIR OPTIMUM UTILIZATION.</narrative>
  </description>
